<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
<meta name="color-scheme" content="light">
<meta name="supported-color-schemes" content="light">
</head>
<body style="margin:0;padding:0;background:#f2f0ec">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="background:#f2f0ec"><tr><td align="center" style="padding:24px 12px">
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="max-width:600px;background:#ffffff"><tr><td style="padding:28px 24px;font-family:'IBM Plex Sans',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;color:#1e1a16">

<p style="margin:0 0 8px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e1a16">Hosts still present the previous secret of NSS key <span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .KeyName }}</span> (<span style="font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .KeyID }}</span>), which was rotated at {{ datetime .RotatedAt }}.</p>
{{ if .PreviousExpiresAt.Equal .RotatedAt }}
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">The previous secret stopped working when the key was rotated, so those hosts are refused until they present the new one.</p>
{{ else }}
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">The previous secret keeps working until {{ datetime .PreviousExpiresAt }} ({{ until .PreviousExpiresAt }}). After that, the hosts listed below stop resolving accounts through this key.</p>
{{ end }}
<p style="margin:0 0 24px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">Redeploy the secret issued by the rotation to the hosts listed below before that time. Hosts that already present the new secret are not listed.</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
<tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Switched to the new secret</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ .Switched }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Still on the previous secret</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ .NotSwitched }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:14px;line-height:1.375;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Not seen since the rotation</td><td style="padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:16px;line-height:1.375;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums">{{ .Gone }}</td></tr>
</table>
{{ if .NotSwitchedAddresses }}
<p style="margin:24px 0 8px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;color:#1e1a16">Still presenting the previous secret, most recently seen first</p>
<ul style="margin:0 0 16px;padding-left:20px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#1e1a16">
{{ range .NotSwitchedAddresses }}<li style="margin:0 0 4px;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ . }}</li>
{{ end }}</ul>
{{ if .MoreNotSwitched }}<p style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">and {{ .MoreNotSwitched }} more. The full list is in the key's rotation report.</p>
{{ end }}{{ end }}
{{ if .Advanced }}
<p style="margin:32px 0 4px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.25;letter-spacing:.06em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#5d5751">Details</p>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" width="100%" style="border-collapse:collapse">
<tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Key ID</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .KeyID }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Generation</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ .Generation }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Rotated at</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ datetime .RotatedAt }}</td></tr>
<tr><td style="padding:8px 16px 8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#5d5751;white-space:nowrap;vertical-align:top;width:1%">Previous expires</td><td style="padding:8px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:13px;line-height:1.25;color:#1e1a16;vertical-align:top;word-break:break-word;font-family:'IBM Plex Mono',ui-monospace,SFMono-Regular,Menlo,Consolas,monospace">{{ datetime .PreviousExpiresAt }}</td></tr>
</table>
{{ end }}
<p style="margin:32px 0 0;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e0ddda;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;color:#5d5751">
Sent to the notification address of NSS key {{ .KeyName }}, which defaults to its creator. This message is always sent: it is not a notification preference and cannot be turned off.
</p>
</td></tr></table>
</td></tr></table>
</body>
</html>
